  "body": "This project is a deep live-ops gameplay designed for League of Legends: Wild Rift (CN). By integrating \"Roguelike Bullet-hell\" mechanics with \"Character Progression\" systems, the initiative drives user engagement and commercial conversion. In partnership with Hongshan Forest Zoo, the design embeds biodiversity conservation into the game's worldview, achieving a profound synergy between online activity and brand Social Responsibility (CSR) values.",
