          "title": "Hongshan Zoo IP Collaboration",
          "logo": "assets/projects/spirited-expedition/hongshan-section-logo-png-web.webp",
          "logoAlt": "League of Legends and Hongshan Forest Zoo",
          "body": "Serving as the online promotional touchpoint for the August 28, 2025 launch of the new Guardian \"Apple\" (Red Panda), two Panda Teemo chroma skins, and the limited-time return of \"Peanut\" (Capybara), this campaign partners with Hongshan Forest Zoo, viral for its \"rejecting animal performances\" philosophy and the popular memes of cute star animals like \"Red Panda Kafei\" and \"Dudu\" (White-faced Saki). By integrating these star animals into the UI as the strategic entry point, this design aims to boost DAU and brand social value, thereby fostering player affinity to ultimately drive purchase conversion.",
